.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK COMMANDS"
.SH NAME
hamstik commands \- Print the machine\-readable command manifest derived from the real command tree, or the copy\-pasteable API cookbook with `\-\-cookbook`
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik commands [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the machine\-readable command manifest derived from the real command tree, or the copy\-pasteable API cookbook with `\-\-cookbook`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --manifest-format
Output format for the manifest
Choices: json
Default: json
.TP
.B --cookbook
Print the copy-pasteable API cookbook derived from the bundled Agent Skill instead of the command manifest
Choices: true, false
